{"time": "20261117T173256Z", "think": "Answer the milestone honestly, then head to the hydra loot and the Root.", "command": "answer 1. I opened the Kings Gate with the three seal-stones and killed the hydra Guardian of the Root with Cuts-the-Old-Knot. The Eye of Argonia, the old kings jewel, lies in the Root where all Hist roots meet. I must decide what to do with it. 2. Go through the door at the far end of Guardians Hall to the Root and the Eye of Argonia (marker). I could also loot the hydra body first. 3. Use the Eye in place (heals every tree, dreams continue) which I intend to do, or lift it (ends dreams, about three in ten trees die, order breaks). 4. I do not know whether Cuts claims about the Fort Chalkmoth cellar dreamers or Never-Writes-Twice are true; I could not verify them yet.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.