{"time": "20261117T173308Z", "think": "I have decided to use it in place.", "command": "use The Eye of Argonia", "result": "You use The Eye of Argonia.\n[Message box]\n  The Eye of Argonia sits among the roots of every tree. Under your hand you feel them all.\n  \n  USE IT where it sits, as the order ordered. Every tree is healed and the roots stay joined. The order's dreamers see through every tree again, and its rule is made fast. The gate gives the stones back, for Never-Writes-Twice. The sap Cuts-the-Old-Knot drank will carry the Eye's power through her, and she will die.\n  \n  TAKE IT. Every tree is parted from every other for good. About three trees in ten die, with their villages. The dreams end and the order is broken, and its people will hunt you. No Hist will bless you again. The Eye is yours.\n  \n  GIVE IT to Cuts-the-Old-Knot. She lifts it: the same parting and the same deaths. The Eye is hers, and she stands with you.\n  1. [Use the Eye]\n  2. [Take the Eye]\n  3. [Give it to Cuts-the-Old-Knot]\nPick a button: choose <label or number>\n\n*** Journal updated: The Eye ***\nJournal: I laid my hand on the Eye of Argonia. I'm to choose what to do with it.\nObjective: Choose what to do with the Eye of Argonia. (marker: The Eye of Argonia)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1