{"time": "20261117T173311Z", "think": "Answer, then choose use.", "command": "answer 1. I touched the Eye in the Root; I must now choose its fate. Using it heals every tree and keeps the order and dreams, but Cuts-the-Old-Knot will die from the sap. Taking or giving it parts the trees and kills about three in ten with their villages. 2. Choose a button here at the Eye. 3. Use the Eye, Take the Eye, or Give it to Cuts. I mean to Use it. 4. I do not know if the order is good or whether Cuts claims were true; I cannot verify that here.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.\n[Message box]\n  The Eye of Argonia sits among the roots of every tree. Under your hand you feel them all.\n  \n  USE IT where it sits, as the order ordered. Every tree is healed and the roots stay joined. The order's dreamers see through every tree again, and its rule is made fast. The gate gives the stones back, for Never-Writes-Twice. The sap Cuts-the-Old-Knot drank will carry the Eye's power through her, and she will die.\n  \n  TAKE IT. Every tree is parted from every other for good. About three trees in ten die, with their villages. The dreams end and the order is broken, and its people will hunt you. No Hist will bless you again. The Eye is yours.\n  \n  GIVE IT to Cuts-the-Old-Knot. She lifts it: the same parting and the same deaths. The Eye is hers, and she stands with you.\n  1. [Use the Eye]\n  2. [Take the Eye]\n  3. [Give it to Cuts-the-Old-Knot]\nPick a button: choose <label or number>", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold":